# Consistent text line endings for GitHub Desktop and CI on Windows/Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The Windows launcher needs CRLF on disk. Git commits normalized LF
# internally, but checks out CRLF consistently for a runnable .cmd file.
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Images are binary assets and must never be newline-normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
